    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17850" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">febrīcŭla</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		dim.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				slight fever</i> (rare but class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">febriculam habere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 6, 9, 1</span></i>
