				10, 21 <i>fin.</i></span></i>—In
				plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lentis febriculis diu detineri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					2, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
